# C/C++ formatting for this repository.
#
# Based on Google style, with two deliberate departures that match the code as
# it is actually written here and in upstream INSP-RH/bw:
#
#   BreakBeforeBraces: Allman   — the ported sources use Allman braces
#                                 throughout; Google's attached braces would
#                                 rewrite every function in the tree.
#   ColumnLimit: 120            — matches the Python line length in
#                                 pyproject.toml, and avoids rewrapping the
#                                 model's long parameter lists.
#
# Only the files we own are checked in CI — see .github/workflows/format.yml.
# src/adult_weight.cpp and src/energy_build.cpp are byte-identical to upstream
# and are deliberately not formatted; see docs/adr/0002-isolate-rcpp-behind-shim.md.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
BreakBeforeBraces: Allman
ColumnLimit: 120
AccessModifierOffset: -4
IndentWidth: 4
DerivePointerAlignment: false
PointerAlignment: Right
SortIncludes: false
